    "title": "Sam Houston High student carrying gun on campus arrested, CPSO says - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KPLC Digital Team ,\n6 hours ago MOSS BLUFF, La. (KPLC) - A Sam Houston High School student was arrested for carrying a gun on campus, according to the Calcasieu Parish Sheriff’s Office. Deputies say they were told a student on campus was possibly in possession of a firearm at 2:50 p.m. Aug 26. After the student was detained, deputies found a gun in their backpack. The student, later identified as Ja’Vonte Pete, 18, of Lake Charles, was arrested by CPSO and SROs at the school. Read full article",
    "summary": "By KPLC Digital Team , 6 hours ago MOSS BLUFF, La. (KPLC) - A Sam Houston High School student was arrested for carrying a gun on campus, according to the Calcasieu Parish Sheriff’s Office. Deputies say they were told a student on campus was possibly in possession of a firearm at 2:50 p.m. Aug 26. After the student was detained, deputies found a gun in their backpack. The student, later identified as Ja’Vonte Pete, 18, of Lake Charles, was arrested by CPSO and SROs at the school.",
